    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Matrix in place - markers</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/set-matrix-zeroes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 73</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Set Matrix Zeroes</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Use row 0 and column 0 as the row/column flag arrays, plus one boolean for column 0 (the corner cell can only mean one thing); apply the flags bottom-up so the markers are read before they are overwritten. O(m·n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
